    "style": "KORT",
    "text": "Locked camera, one continuous shot. Her hand nearest the shoe goes low over the felt to the yellow card lying close in front of her, in the middle of the picture, where the last frame shows it. There her thumb slides under the long edge nearest it and lifts it as her wrist turns thumb side up; the card rolls over on its opposite long edge, which stays on the felt, and her thumb comes over onto the blue side. Her open hand glides back low over the felt, palm down, and comes to rest flat on the felt. The other hand rests on the felt. Only one card moves. It is yellow on one side and blue on the other: it lies yellow side up, and after the turn it lies blue side up.",
